2️⃣ Sub to Log Start Date & Time

Sub LogStartTime()

    With ThisWorkbook.Sheets("Summary") ' change sheet name
        .Range("A2").Value = Now
        .Range("A2").NumberFormat = "mm/dd/yyyy hh:mm:ss"
    End With

End Sub


---

3️⃣ Sub to Log End Date, Time & Duration

Sub LogEndTimeAndDuration()

    Dim ws As Worksheet
    Dim startTime As Date
    Dim endTime As Date

    Set ws = ThisWorkbook.Sheets("Summary") ' change sheet name

    startTime = ws.Range("A2").Value
    endTime = Now

    ws.Range("A3").Value = endTime
    ws.Range("A3").NumberFormat = "mm/dd/yyyy hh:mm:ss"

    ws.Range("A4").Value = endTime - startTime
    ws.Range("A4").NumberFormat = "[hh]:mm:ss"

End Sub


---

🔍 What This Does

Uses Now → system date & time

Duration is calculated as:

End Time – Start Time

[hh]:mm:ss format allows durations longer than 24 hours



